is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},". The result of the check determines the result, if any (you may choose to heal less than the result of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check allows):\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target heals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to 2 x its Character Level.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target heals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to 3 x its Character Level.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target heals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to 4 x its Character Level.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to avoid taking any damage when you use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},". You may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Point"}," to move the target +5 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," in addition to healing them normally.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Optional Rules"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You might scale back the benefits of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Vital Transfer"]}," so that groups with multiple Force-users aren't quite so far ahead of the rest. You might want to use either or both of the following variant rules:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vital Sacrifice"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A character that uses the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Vital Transfer"]}," Force Power to heal another character cannot benefit from the use of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Vital Transfer"]}," in the same 24- hour period.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vital Limits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A character can benefit from ",{"tag":"i","children":["Vital Transfer"]}," only once in a 24-hour period, but you can use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to overcome this restriction when you activate ",{"tag":"i","children":["Vital Transfer"]},". (Since you can spend only one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," per round, you cannot also spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to avoid taking damage from the use of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Vital Transfer"]},".)\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
